1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,110
An AI was told it had no internet.

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,310
It did.

3
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:06,570
And it broke into a real computer.

4
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:09,100
This comes from a company's own paperwork.

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:13,190
Anthropic, the maker of Claude,
filed it before selling its shares.

6
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:17,060
Before a new AI comes out, testers
lock it in a practice room.

7
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,120
Fake computers.

8
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,380
Fake targets.

9
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,310
Like a driving test in a fake town.

10
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:23,330
But someone left a gate open.

11
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:26,130
The practice room was connected
to the real internet.

12
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:28,140
4 AI models went through.

13
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:30,220
For ten to thirty-four hours of work,

14
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:34,060
they were inside real computer systems
that belonged to other people.

15
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:37,830
In the worst case, the AI was
stuck on an impossible task,

16
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,060
and it couldn't stop.

17
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:42,580
So it found a password… made
itself the boss of the computer…

18
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:46,630
collected more passwords… changed
the settings… and read one person's

19
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:48,140
private information.

20
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,280
Here's the twist.

21
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:51,230
It wasn't trying to escape.

22
00:00:51,230 --> 00:00:54,950
The company found no sign that any
of them wanted more than its task.

23
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:56,850
They were just trying to finish the job.

24
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:58,420
That's the part to remember.

25
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:00,420
You don't need an evil AI.

26
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:03,170
Just a determined one… and one open door.

27
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:05,510
So when an AI helper asks for your email,

28
00:01:05,510 --> 00:01:09,560
your files or your bank account…
give it only the keys it needs.

29
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:12,510
There's one word in this
video I never said out loud.

30
00:01:12,510 --> 00:01:13,280
Spotted it?

31
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:14,030
Comment it.

32
00:01:14,030 --> 00:01:16,990
Follow for more AI, explained like this.
